<section class="pd-reviews" aria-label="리뷰 목록">
    <h2 class="pd-section-title">리뷰</h2>
    {{#inProductReviewList}}
        <article class="pd-review">
            <header>
                <span class="pd-review-stars" aria-label="{{rating}}점">{{stars}}</span>
                <span class="pd-review-user">{{username}}</span>
            </header>
            <div class="pd-review-body">
                {{#reviewImage}}<img src="{{reviewImage}}" alt="리뷰 사진">{{/reviewImage}}
                <p>{{content}}</p>
            </div>
        </article>
    {{/inProductReviewList}}
    {{^inProductReviewList}}
        <div class="pd-empty">
            <i class="bi bi-chat-left-dots" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <p>아직 리뷰가 없어요. 구매 후 첫 리뷰를 남겨 주세요.</p>
        </div>
    {{/inProductReviewList}}
</section>
